OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK government approves Jackdaw gas
OL,4,Afield and says production will start
OL,5,Athis month
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Energy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh
OL,8,Ftells the BBC the gas from Jackdaw
OL,9,F"won't lower energy bills this winter"
OL,11,FGreen Party leader in England and
OL,12,FWales, Zack Polanski, calls the Jackdaw
OL,13,Fdecision "climate vandalism", adding:
OL,14,F"This is a victory for Shell over the
OL,15,Fpeople"
OL,17,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch backs
OL,18,Fthe decision, but accuses the
OL,19,Fgovernment of "faffing about"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
